And that matters more than, in my opinion,

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:44.250
than any kind of potential baby.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.090
- [Person] Yeah, absolutely.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:46.988
I feel like because of this-

00:10:46.988 --> 00:10:49.620
The dissolve of Roe v. Wade,

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:53.310
like, I feel, like, I don't even wanna try

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:54.180
to have kids anymore.

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:57.450
Like, they're doing the
opposite thing to us.

00:10:57.450 --> 00:10:59.130
There are so many women who want to try,

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:01.980
but we've heard the stories
of women who have miscarriages

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:03.637
and go in and try to get
seen by a doctor and say,

00:11:03.637 --> 00:11:05.880
"We can't do that till
until we call your lawyer."

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:07.260
And I have so many health issues.

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:09.270
I have endometriosis, I have PCOs,

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.370
like, I have everything under
the female sun (chuckles)

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.750
that could exist.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:16.890
I could very easily carry a
pregnancy that's not good.

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:19.560
I could very easily die
from ectopic pregnancy.

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:22.770
And the fear that if for
one day this expanded

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:27.390
and reached where I live,
I could die, you know.

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.190
And it's so scary.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:31.320
And it deters women like
me who are on the fence

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:32.986
from even wanting to have kids.

00:11:32.986 --> 00:11:34.897
(audio thumps)

00:11:34.897 --> 00:11:37.415
- [Narrator] "The future isn't female."

00:11:37.415 --> 00:11:40.216
(countdown chiming)

00:11:40.216 --> 00:11:42.883
(audio beeping)

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:47.970
- [Mabel] As much as I wanna fight for it,

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:51.240
I see this misogyny in my brothers.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:52.950
And, you know, my father even told me

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:54.307
when I was in high school,
I asked him, I said,

00:11:54.307 --> 00:11:57.870
"Do you think that men
are superior to women?"

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:00.060
And he said, "Yeah," to my face.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:03.480
I'm his eldest daughter,
his only daughter.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:04.320
You know.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.520
So that (beep) hurts.

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:06.990
And to see that-

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:11.370
It puts a really gray tone
over the world for you,

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.260
- [Simone] I guess I'm I'm
super radical and I'm, like,

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:14.603
just end all of this stuff.

00:12:14.603 --> 00:12:15.436
(people chuckling)

00:12:15.436 --> 00:12:20.130
And so I feel like feminism is,
like, is for the time being.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:22.403
I wanna end gender as a whole

00:12:22.403 --> 00:12:25.830
because I think it's
binding and it's oppressive.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:30.830
So, I feel, like, the future
is neither female nor male.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:33.690
- [Shay] I don't know, I do
like the concept of gender

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:38.130
because to some degree it is
not who we are as a whole,

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:39.240
but it does make us.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:42.360
I like identifying as a woman

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:45.217
and also I'll challenge that by saying,

00:12:45.217 --> 00:12:47.730
"Who are gonna be the
ones to be the voices

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:50.250
for queer people and non-binaries

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.050
because it's not gonna be cis hetero men?"

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:52.883
- [Maya] That's true, yeah, yeah.

00:12:52.883 --> 00:12:54.240
- [Shay] It's gonna be women.

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:55.410
- [Maya] Yeah, yeah.
- [Person] No.

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:57.684
- [Director] We're gonna have
you put your masks back on.

00:12:57.684 --> 00:13:00.434
(masks rustling)

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:05.029
- Thank you so much.

00:13:05.029 --> 00:13:06.062
(chair clanking)

00:13:06.062 --> 00:13:09.395
(gentle brooding music)

